<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>better for you</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">siopaolo</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">better for you</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2fxoRz7eUFbo5RoHSvXqQh</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.440" end="00:15.450">I've been coping all these nights</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.450" end="00:19.110">Can  never seem to get it right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.110" end="00:25.230">Still you never left from my side</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.230" end="00:28.020">Your friends are saying it's not working</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.020" end="00:31.440">But  in your sight, it's perfect</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.440" end="00:37.380">In my mind, I know that they're right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.380" end="00:40.020">You've been taking all my bullshit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.020" end="00:43.020">While I sit around and make excuses</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.020" end="00:49.200">Why  did I always have to push you away?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.200" end="00:54.870">But most days I relied on the space</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.870" end="01:01.350">You waited patiently, I couldn't do the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.350" end="01:06.960">Please know I did all I can (All I Can)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.960" end="01:13.290">And your suffering was not in the plan</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.290" end="01:16.020">You deserve a man who can't lose</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.020" end="01:21.000">Can't forget I put you through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.000" end="01:24.540">I put you out in the rain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.540" end="01:27.870">You said no ones to blame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.870" end="01:32.760">Tried to wipe all the droplets away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.760" end="01:36.540">But I see the dread in your eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.540" end="01:39.630">While you're telling me lies</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.630" end="01:44.910">How the tears were just rain on your face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.910" end="01:50.700">You're too good to me  my  baby, I know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.700" end="01:56.370">But tell me just why you can't you find someone new</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.370" end="01:59.640">Someone  better for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.640" end="02:01.860">Tell me can you feel someone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.860" end="02:04.890">Tell me can you feel  someone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.890" end="02:08.670">Tell me can you feel someone new</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.670" end="02:13.290">So take back your time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.290" end="02:16.260">I never should've had it anyway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.260" end="02:19.290">Reverse the clock and shoot a better frame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.290" end="02:25.260">And I hope one chance and one day (Day)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.260" end="02:28.290">I'll see your smiling coming back to life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.290" end="02:31.320">And maybe then you'll finally realize</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.320" end="02:34.500">I'm the wrong person and wrong time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.500" end="02:40.020">I never could seem to be (To be)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.020" end="02:46.410">At the right time the person you need (The person you need)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.410" end="02:49.410">You deserve a man who can't lose</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.410" end="02:53.970">One who doesn't put you through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.970" end="02:57.510">I put you out in the rain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.510" end="03:00.870">You said no ones to blame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.870" end="03:05.760">Tried to wipe all the droplets away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.760" end="03:09.540">But I see the dread in your eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.540" end="03:12.630">While you're telling me lies</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.630" end="03:17.880">How the tears were just rain on your face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.880" end="03:23.700">You're too good to me  my baby, I know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:23.700" end="03:27.810">But tell me just why you can't you find someone new</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:27.810" end="03:35.810">Someone  better for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:40.440" end="03:48.440">Sorry I can't be the one you need</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:56.970" end="04:00.540">I put you out in the rain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:00.540" end="04:04.110">You said  no ones to blame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:04.110" end="04:08.760">And you dried all the droplets away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:08.760" end="04:12.510">Now I see the glow in your eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:12.510" end="04:16.020">While you cling to his side</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:16.020" end="04:21.000">And I'll watch as my half face turns to gray</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:21.000" end="04:26.670">I'm so dam proud of you baby, please know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:26.670" end="04:32.310">Don't worry bout me when you have someone new</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:32.310" end="04:40.140">Someone better for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:40.140" end="04:44.140">Cause you deserve a man who can't lose</p></div></body></tt>